# Z: ground effect vs height, nominal PID only (mrac_injection=0). Hover 0.8 m, then z-only out-and-back legs that
#   dwell 12 s at 0.3, 0.5 and 1.2 m. Fit: hover thrust ratio vs h, g(h) = (h0/h)^2 candidate for Z block 1, bit1.
# Below 0.3 m, ground effect is seen only in the takeoff and slow-landing segments (DSL/fence gap: z >= 0.3).
# Fly it: fly lab_z_ground_effect --once at >= 15.8 V resting. UNVERIFIED: never flown. Airborne ~75 s computed.
campaign lab-z-ground-effect
rate 100
log velocity_loops camera_fusion thrust_model
slow 25 mrac_3l ekf_states estimator_truth
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10
takeoff 0.8 mrac_injection=0
hold 12
goto x=0 y=0 z=0.3 dwell_s=12
goto x=0 y=0 z=0.5 dwell_s=12
goto x=0 y=0 z=1.2 dwell_s=12
land
